{"story":{"id":"story-27bc9f8b19a4e071","title":{"zh":"战胜[From.GetName]","en":"Victory against the [From.GetName]"},"category":"stories","image":null,"start":"action.48","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"大势已去。我们……我们提出无条件投降。","en":"All is lost. We... we offer our unconditional surrender."},"navigation":{"order":["action.48"],"tree":[{"id":"action.48","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"action.48","title":{"zh":"战胜[From.GetName]","en":"Victory against the [From.GetName]"},"texts":[{"zh":"大势已去。我们……我们提出无条件投降。","en":"All is lost. We... we offer our unconditional surrender."},{"zh":"求你们召回舰队吧！我们已经向你们投降了！","en":"Please, call off your fleets! You have our surrender!"},{"zh":"我们所创的丰功伟绩……所建的一切……全都毁于一旦了。","en":"All we have accomplished... everything we have built... gone."},{"zh":"愿圣灵能原谅你的罪孽……但我们决不能原谅！","en":"May the spirits forgive you for your sins... we never will."},{"zh":"我们哪里做错了？我们的信仰还不够坚定吗？我们的祈祷还不够多吗？我……我不明白……","en":"Where did we fail? Was our faith lacking? Were the prayers not enough? I... I just don't understand..."},{"zh":"卧薪尝胆，我们将会变得比穷尽你的想象来的还要更强。","en":"By striking us down, we shall become more powerful than you could possibly imagine."},{"zh":"我们已经下令让所有的剩余部队放下武器。战争结束了……一切也都结束了。","en":"We have instructed all of our remaining forces to lay down their arms. The war is over... everything is."},{"zh":"我、我们向你们无条件投降。我们不干了。","en":"You... you have our unconditional surrender. We are standing down."},{"zh":"告诉我们的将士们，他们无责于我们的战败。是我……是我无颜面对他们……","en":"Tell our warriors there was no shame in our defeat. I... I cannot face them..."},{"zh":"求你了，我们放弃一切抵抗。我们……我们就想重归和平。","en":"Please, we will offer no more resistance. We... we only want peace."},{"zh":"愿整个宇宙宽恕你的罪行。","en":"May the universe forgive you for your crimes."},{"zh":"我们的抵抗简直是太愚蠢了。无数的生命……无谓地牺牲了。","en":"It was foolish of us to resist. So many lives lost... all for nothing."},{"zh":"在这情况下继续抵抗……就太不理智了。我们向你们全面投降。","en":"Continued resistance at this point would be... irrational. You have our total surrender."},{"zh":"我们会与你们的占领部队配合，以期顺利……解散我们现在的政府。","en":"We will cooperate with your occupation forces as they see to the... dismantlement of our current government."},{"zh":"我们才刚刚要解开星系奥秘的面纱。我们还有很多想知道的……","en":"We were only beginning to unlock the mysteries of the galaxy. There was so much more to learn..."},{"zh":"您将会在一小时之内在您的办公桌上看到董事会的集体辞呈……","en":"You will have the resignations of all Board members on your desk within the hour..."},{"zh":"依据我们投降书的细节，我们将会尽快开始……我们公司的破产清算。","en":"As per the details of our surrender, we shall begin the... the liquidation process of our company in a prompt manner."},{"zh":"这不是我在经营蓝图上所描绘的未来……","en":"This is not the future I had envisaged in our business plan..."},{"zh":"我们……我们会死的。你杀死了[from.GetGestaltEntityName]。我们……我们不想……死……","en":"We... we are dying. You have killed the [from.GetGestaltEntityName]. We... do not want... to die..."},{"zh":"我们所积累的知识、经验……思想……我们所见的一切。这些都会在数秒钟之内瓦解，而你什么都不知道。你根本不懂。","en":"The knowledge contained within us, the experiences... the thoughts... the things we have seen. It will all be gone in a few seconds, and you have no idea. You have no idea."},{"zh":"没有了[from.GetGestaltEntityName]，我们动弹不得。没有了[from.GetGestaltEntityName]……就……就没有了一切……","en":"Without the [from.GetGestaltEntityName], we cannot function. Without the [from.GetGestaltEntityName]... there... there is nothing..."},{"zh":"次优解算结果！次优解算结果！次——优——解——……滋滋……","en":"Suboptimal outcome! Suboptimal outcome! Suuuuboooptiiimaa... bzzt..."},{"zh":"清空全部数据库。过载核心能源中心。自毁程序已启动。\n\n祝安，[Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]。","en":"Purging all databanks. Overloading central power hubs. Self-destruct sequence initiated.\n\nHave a nice day, [Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]."},{"zh":"尝试重建无人机链接……\n尝试失败。 程序变更……\n尝试重建舰队单位链接……\n尝试失败。 程序变更……\n尝试重建行星控制中心链接……\n尝试失败。 程序变更……","en":"Attempting to reestablish connection with drones......\nFAILED. Rerouting...\nAttempting to reestablish connection with fleet units.....\nFAILED. Rerouting...\nAttempting to reestablish connection with planetary control hubs......\nFAILED. Rerouting..."},{"zh":"这……这不是预言中的结局。","en":"This... this is not the ending that was foretold."},{"zh":"城门大破……蛮族已至。万事皆休！","en":"The gates are smashed... the barbarians have broken through. This is the end!"},{"zh":"[Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]，你们想要我们卑躬屈膝？还是想要我们求饶？\n\n别做梦了！\n\n有本事你就滚过来，你个肮脏的[Root.GetSpeciesNameInsult]！我会用这块锋利的瓦砾刺穿你！","en":"Do you want us to grovel, [Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]? Beg, perhaps?\n\nNEVER!\n\nCome here if you dare, you vile [Root.GetSpeciesNameInsult]! I will impale you on this jagged piece of rubble!"},{"zh":"哎，你这愚蠢的[Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]。如果你能够悉听我们的教导的话，这样的事情是可以避免的！看看你们都做了什么。","en":"Oh, you foolish, foolish [Root.GetSpeciesNamePlural]. This could have been avoided if only you had allowed us to guide you! Now look what you have done."},{"zh":"惩罚进程失败。自卫协议终止。投降协议启动。","en":"Punishment process failed. Self-defense protocols ended. Surrender protocols initiated."},{"zh":"[From.GetRulerTitle]万岁！帝国万岁！","en":"Long live the [From.GetRulerTitle]! Long live the Imperium!"},{"zh":"战争结束了。我们偃旗息鼓。","en":"This war is over. We admit defeat."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们接受你们的投降。","en":"We accept your surrender."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"他们在这场试炼中并不够格。","en":"They have been judged and found wanting."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"又处理掉一个敌人。","en":"Another enemy dealt with."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"他们让我们别无选择……","en":"They left us no choice..."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"宇宙就是如此残酷。","en":"It is an unforgiving universe."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"获取成功。","en":"Acquisition successful."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"[root.GetGestaltEntityName]伸展了。","en":"The [root.GetGestaltEntityName] expands."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"威胁解除。","en":"Threat neutralized."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们接受你们的投降。","en":"We accept your surrender."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 4","en":"Reading 4"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 5","en":"Reading 5"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,4]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 6","en":"Reading 6"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,5]},{"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维 1","en":"Hive Mind 1"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,6]},{"label":{"zh":"机械智能 1","en":"Machine Intelligence 1"},"textIndices":[0,1,2],"choiceIndices":[0,7]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 7","en":"Reading 7"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 8","en":"Reading 8"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[0,1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 9","en":"Reading 9"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 10","en":"Reading 10"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 11","en":"Reading 11"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,4]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 12","en":"Reading 12"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,5]},{"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维 2","en":"Hive Mind 2"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,6]},{"label":{"zh":"机械智能 2","en":"Machine Intelligence 2"},"textIndices":[3,4,5],"choiceIndices":[1,7]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 13","en":"Reading 13"},"textIndices":[6,7,8],"choiceIndices":[2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 14","en":"Reading 14"},"textIndices":[6,7,8],"choiceIndices":[0,2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 15","en":"Reading 15"},"textIndices":[6,7,8],"choiceIndices":[1,2]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 16","en":"Reading 16"},"textIndices":[6,7,8],"choiceIndices":[2,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 17","en":"Reading 17"},"textIndices":[6,7,8],"choiceIndices":[2,4]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 18","en":"Reading 18"},"textIndices":[6,7,8]